<title>POLAND: Farm Food rights issue price at PLN 30-35.</title>
<headline>Farm Food rights issue price at PLN 30-35.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish food producer Farm Food SA set the issue price of its planned 600,000-share rights issue at between 30 to 35 zlotys, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>The firm said the final issue price would be set two days before the record day, which has yet to be announced.</p>
<p>Farm Food currently has 2.9 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
